436 0 obj
<<
  /Type /StructElem
  /S /Figure
  /P 435 0 R
  /Alt (Scatter plot of person location at occasion 1 against occasion 2, both in logits from about -4 to 4. Points fall on a discrete grid because attainable scores are discrete. A grey stepped band runs along the diagonal, narrow near the centre of the scale and wider towards each end before narrowing again at the extremes. Points inside the band are grey and labelled as no detected change, points above it are green and labelled as an increase, and one point below it is orange and labelled as a decrease. Most points sit above the diagonal, reflecting the simulated improvement.)
  /A [<<
    /O /Layout
    /Placement /Block
  >>]
  /K [0]
  /Pg 1344 0 R
>>
endobj

